metadata/design_notes = "A call centre: four cubicles in the corners, each with an enemy at its desk, and two partitions making an aisle down the middle. Every enemy starts with a wall on two sides, so the fight is about the angle into each cubicle rather than raw aim, and the aisle between the partitions is cover from all four."
